<main id="main" class="wrap interior"><p class="eyebrow">YOU DON’T HAVE TO GO ALONE</p><h1>A listening ear.<br><em>A place to start.</em></h1><p class="intro">You don’t need to have the right words to reach out. Explore support that fits where you are.</p><div class="two-column"><section class="content-panel green-card"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">♡</span><h2>Find someone to talk to.</h2><p>Find A Helpline lets you explore emotional support and crisis helplines by country and topic, including phone, text, and chat options where available.</p><a class="button" href="https://findahelpline.com/">Find a helpline near you ↗</a></section><section class="content-panel lavender"><span class="card-icon" aria-hidden="true">☷</span><h2>Learn at your own pace.</h2><p>Explore the World Health Organization’s introduction to mental health, its influences, and the importance of access to care.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/mental-health-strengthening-our-response">Visit WHO’s mental health guide ↗</a></section></div><section class="content-panel"><h2>Need urgent help?</h2><p>If you or someone else is in immediate danger, contact your local emergency services or go to the nearest emergency department.</p><p>This site does not provide counseling or monitor requests for help. The links above take you to independent services; their availability and privacy policies may differ.</p></section><a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to your space</a></main>
